Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:47.23,Signs,,0,0,0,,نار
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:47.23,Signs,,0,0,0,,أرض
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:47.23,Signs,,0,0,0,,معدن
